# Agent Folder Manager
error-afm-datastore-failed = ordin's records are busy right now. Try again in a moment.
error-afm-folder-busy = That agent's folder is in use. Try again in a moment.
error-afm-folder-exists = A folder for that agent already exists.
error-afm-folder-not-found = ordin can't find a folder ready for that agent. Set the agent up again.
error-afm-grant-invalid = That access belongs to a different workspace and can't be used here.
error-afm-io-failed = ordin couldn't read or write the agent's files. Check there is free space on your computer and try again.
error-afm-root-unwritable = ordin can't create or write to its storage folder. Check the folder's permissions and free space.
error-afm-session-unknown = ordin can't find the agent for that work. Start the work again.
